<ul class="primary">
    <li>Protection Code is a code used to access your account in emergency situations.</li>
    <li>
        When your account is logged in by the protection code, you can only access the following functions:
        <ul class="secondary">
            <li>Win Loss Detail report</li>
            <li>Win Loss By Product report</li>
            <li>Commission By Bet Type report</li>
            <li>Results report</li>
            <li>Normal Announcement</li>
            <li>Special Announcement</li>
            <li>System Announcement</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>Once your account is logged in by the protection code, "Protection Mode" will be turned on for your account and only your upline or Customer Service Staff can turn off this mode.</p>
    </li>
</ul>
